<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Dec 17.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Dec 17.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule</p>
<p>of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Tuticorin port</p>
<p>on December 17:</p>
<p> Commodity	    Tons/TEUS		Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		   (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>General	    ---/230 (LDD)    ---/  7 S.Elizabeth	15/12</p>
<p>General	    500/--- (LDD)    ---/--- Vila		 14/12</p>
<p>Granite	  5,244/--- (LDD)  2,756/--- State Of Tripura 13/12</p>
<p>Raw Cashew     2,245/--- (ULD)    797/--  Fagaras	    12/12</p>
<p>Coal	    19,079/--- (ULD)  6,446/--  Prabhu Mihika    14/12</p>
<p>Raw Cashew     1,695/--- (ULD)  4,436/--  Feng Zhan	  13/12</p>
<p>Coal	    20,694/--- (ULD)  7,447/--  Surya Kiruba     14/12</p>
<p>Coal	     3,759/--- (ULD) 16,725/--  C.Veeram	   13/12</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>		  Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Tuticorin)</p>
